### 8. Policy Implementation Interface
```python
class ControlPolicy:
    async def process_request(
        request: Request, 
        target_url: str, 
        headers: Dict[str, str], 
        body: Optional[bytes]
    ) -> Dict[str, Any]

    async def process_response(
        request: Request, 
        response: httpx.Response, 
        content: bytes
    ) -> Dict[str, Any]
```

